{"id":"n62596-2-5","stage":3,"title":"쏘다 · 伤人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62596-2-5-1","ko":"공부나 하지 그런 건 알아서 뭐하냐?","zh":"好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부나","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부나","audio":"/audio/5fd18d7b75ab3c891d34.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"알아서","meaning":"知道、了解（那些事情）","explanation":"그런 건 알아서 뭐하냐 是知道那些又有什么用的反问；알다 表示获得相关知识，不是参与管理的管。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아서","audio":"/audio/697920d26a64e7313e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐하냐?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐하냐","audio":"/audio/e8e1177cae46f2636eed.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道、明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"知道、明白","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/a578369358f12f9ef682.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62596-2-5-2","ko":"그렇게 쏘지만 마시고 답을 해 주세요.","zh":"别光这样冲我说话，请回答一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"쏘지만","meaning":"光这样冲人说话（后接禁止）","explanation":"쏘다 指说话尖刻；쏘지만 在这里拆为 쏘- + -지 + 만，和后面的 말다 形成不要光这样说的表达，不是表示虽然的 -지만。","readings":[{"term":"쏘다","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62596","senseId":"2","lemma":"쏘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏘지만","audio":"/audio/44fd568e11a09e8bd58e.mp3"}},{"text":"마시고","meaning":"不要（接 -지 表示禁止）","explanation":"-지 말다 是禁止前面行为的辅助表达；-시- 尊敬对方，-고 连接后面的请求，要求对方不要光说尖刻的话而应给出回答。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시고","audio":"/audio/3b14606c16e648320f9e.mp3"}},{"text":"답을","meaning":"应答，解答","explanation":"답：应答，解答；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답을","audio":"/audio/bc4dd04de48702371421.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b4a8059171443b9b","term":"쏘다","zh":"用尖刻的话伤人、顶撞","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3","entryId":"62596","definition":"用尖刻的话伤人、顶撞","pronunciation":["쏘ː다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"应答，解答","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对疑问或问题所要求的内容进行阐明；或指那种话。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae070bf1b54a24132ca9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.807,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62596","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4604,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别这样冲我说话，请回答一下。","好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？","别光这样冲我说话，请回答一下。"],"answer":2}]}
